WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:02.920
The Digital World,

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:06.040
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.560
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:18.260
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.060
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.660
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:53.030
We came to the sixth 
Kingdom, Canyon Land,

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:55.180
where the Death General 
Gravimon awaited us.

00:01:55.770 --> 00:02:00.130
We followed Kiriha's lead against 
the enemy's overwhelming forces,

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:02.450
but we were thoroughly defeated.

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:07.270
Gravimon, appearing before Kiriha 
when his pride was injured,

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.040
opened the door to Kiriha's heavy heart.

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:13.310
And then, Kiriha...

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:22.340
<b>With Strong Love!</b>

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:22.340
<b>Deckerdramon's Final Shout!!</b>

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:19.440
With Strong Love! 
Deckerdramon's Final Shout!!

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:29.930
Nene, you okay?

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:30.410
Yeah.

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.530
Darn it, what is he doing?

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.320
Kiriha, stop this!

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:41.070
Are you being manipulated by someone?!

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.190
No!

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:46.660
Taiki, I planned to settle 
the score with you

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.920
after Bagramon was defeated.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:51.310
I've only changed the 
order of things a bit.

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:55.570
There were times when I felt 
friendship toward you all,

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:59.620
but you were bound to 
become my enemies one day.

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:02.490
The strongest one in this world is me!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.940
<i>Stronger... Become stronger!</i>

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:11.700
Me, Kiriha Aonuma!

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:13.000
Kiriha...

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:15.670
Kiriha.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.830
I will defeat you here,

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:22.510
and I will earn the 
title of the strongest!

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:26.820
MetalGreymon, Digivolve!

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:32.520
ZekeGreymon!

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:35.920
Stop it, Kiriha! 
I don't want to fight my friend!

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.600
It's no use, Taiki.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:38.060
Nene...

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:42.200
He doesn't see us as friends.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:51.310
She's right. The only thing 
on his mind is winning.

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:54.670
Talking won't do any 
good this time, Taiki.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.150
Kiriha is scary...

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.570
What do we do?

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.380
If we're going to fight, let's get to it!

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:00.980
Wait, guys!

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.890
Shoutmon and I will stop Kiriha.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.060
Yeah!

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:07.420
Hey, ZekeGreymon!

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:08.790
Are you sure about this?

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:11.680
My General is Kiriha.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.830
I will do as Kiriha says.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.840
What?!

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:19.690
I thought you were our friend!

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:23.740
Shoutmon!

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.740
Digivolve!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:30.420
Shoutmon, Digivolve!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.250
OmegaShoutmon!

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:39.360
It's a friend's job to 
correct a friend's mistakes!

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.090
Right!

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.160
Zeke Flame!

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:44.200
Beat Slash!

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:58.640
Trident Fang!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.750
Hard Rock Damashi!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.620
Plasma Railgun!

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.280
Face him with your strongest attack!

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:16.540
Final Strikes!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:24.360
Omega the Fusion!

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.320
OmegaShoutmon!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.100
Shoutmon!

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:47.890
Ow... That hard-headed little...

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:49.060
Are you okay?

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:50.600
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.610
Don't worry about me, Taiki.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:57.100
ZekeGreymon! Now! Finish this!

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:05.140
His Digivolution wore off...

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:07.080
Does that mean it's a draw?

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:10.240
MetalGreymon, what are you doing?!

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.680
Digivolve! Crush them!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.350
MetalGreymon!

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:22.490
I stopped the big idiot.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:23.030
Shoutmon!

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:25.010
Get in the Xros Loader.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.720
You need to recover, quick!

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.590
This isn't the time for that!

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:32.200
I'll do something about Kiriha.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:35.390
But when it comes time 
to fight, I need you.

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.440
Please get in the Xros 
Loader and recover.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.710
If you insist.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.810
Don't let your guard down, Taiki!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:52.990
Kiriha, stop this!

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.110
Enough already!

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.350
Kiriha!

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:59.230
Reload, Cyberdramon!

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.300
Reload, Golemon!

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:06.970
Kiriha!

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:08.540
It's no use, Taiki.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:10.610
He won't listen.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:12.580
Kiriha!

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:21.030
Kiriha, that is enough.

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:23.560
I will not let you harm 
Taiki and the others.

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:24.590
What?!

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:27.710
Taiki, all of you, leave us.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.930
I must speak with Kiriha.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.330
Deckerdramon...

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:38.400
Okay.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:40.540
We'll leave this to you, Deckerdramon.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.370
Let's go, guys!

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:44.600
Hold it!

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:46.790
Cyberdramon, attack!

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.610
Stop!

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:55.150
You defy your General, Deckerdramon?!

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:59.430
I became your protector

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:02.600
because you had strong love within you.

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:06.340
However, right now you are losing 
not only that strong love,

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:09.670
but all the love within you.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.120
Love?

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:15.710
I failed to obtain true strength 
because I had such things in me!

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:17.550
I don't need this!

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:20.610
Kiriha, stop!

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:23.790
You are falling for Gravimon's scheme

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:26.350
and becoming someone you're not.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:28.440
You must not abandon love!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.980
I don't care about Gravimon!

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:32.860
I have to become stronger!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:35.920
All of my enemies in the Digital World,

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:38.160
the Bagra Army, Taiki and the others...

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.740
I will make them all bow before me!

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:44.670
That will be the proof of my strength!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.350
Kiriha,

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:48.960
that makes you no 
different from Bagramon.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:52.010
Fighting that way will lead 
to nothing but hatred.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:53.680
I'll ask you one more time.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:57.650
Deckerdramon, do you refuse 
to follow my orders?

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:02.020
A soldier without love 
is no longer a soldier.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.820
I see.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:08.800
You will betray me, as well.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.160
Betray you?

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.930
Just like my father's subordinates 
once betrayed me!

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:17.040
Cyberdramon! Golemon!

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.950
Attack Deckerdramon!

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.250
Glutton Fang!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:21.900
Stop!

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.930
If you truly care about Kiriha, 
you mustn't do this!

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:29.210
Death Divider!

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:31.680
Deckerdramon!

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:33.790
Cyber Blader!

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:43.370
Kiriha! Stop it!

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:45.010
Kiriha!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:49.210
Deckerdramon's gonna die, Kiriha!

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.440
Kiriha!

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:57.480
Stop, Kiriha!

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:06.850
Stop!

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:18.710
Deckerdramon!

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:22.040
Hang in there, Deckerdramon!

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.230
Taiki...

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:24.860
Are you okay?

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:25.990
He's badly wounded.

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:27.570
I'll fix him!

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:29.650
Yokunaol!

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:33.230
His injuries are too severe!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.650
I can't fully heal them!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.100
Thank you, Cutemon.

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:40.520
But don't waste your energy.

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:42.060
Kiriha!

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:45.810
Kiriha!

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:46.860
Taiki!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.130
Kiriha, why?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:01.020
What has happened?

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:03.180
I have nothing to say to you.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.820
Tell me! We're friends, aren't we?

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:06.980
No, we're not!

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.210
I don't need friends.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:14.670
Friends will just betray me one day.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:16.650
Kiriha...

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:25.630
Kiriha, you once told me...

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:28.970
<i>If that's the case, 
then get stronger, Nene.</i>

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:31.000
<i>Like I did.</i>

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.210
<i>Only strength can cure sadness!</i>

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:37.460
The thing Deckerdramon 
called "strong love,"

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.820
that is what's driving you, isn't it?

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:42.450
Tell us... about you.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.890
I will show you...

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:47.420
Kiriha's past.

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:48.410
What?!

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:49.960
You can do that?

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.860
I am Kiriha's protector.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:57.800
I protect his strong love.

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.030
Is that...

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.580
It's Kiriha, at age 10.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:25.970
<i>Kiriha, what's the matter?</i>

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:30.600
<i>A sixth grader took my game.</i>

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.160
<i>Get it back for me, Mom!</i>

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:36.600
<i>I see.</i>

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.770
<i>Did you ask your father?</i>

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:42.820
<i>Dad...</i>

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.310
<i>Kiriha.</i>

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:48.280
<i>Get it back yourself, Kiriha.</i>

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.380
<i>But he's in sixth grade!</i>

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:52.320
<i>I can't beat him!</i>

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:57.570
<i>Don't think about losing before 
you even begin to fight!</i>

00:12:58.150 --> 00:12:59.630
<i>Become stronger.</i>

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:03.830
<i>Only by becoming stronger can 
you become Kiriha Aonuma!</i>

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:07.900
<i>Become... Kiriha Aonuma...</i>

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:08.840
<i>That's right!</i>

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:11.850
<i>Those who aren't strong 
have no right to live.</i>

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:13.910
<i>Come hell or high water, you must win!</i>

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:17.150
<i>Honey, he's only 10 years old!</i>

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.800
<i>Keep quiet.</i>

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:22.120
<i>Kiriha is the successor 
of the Aonuma Group,</i>

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:24.770
<i>the man who will hold more 
than 100 businesses together.</i>

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:27.990
Kiriha...

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:32.280
My dad tried to raise 
me to become a leader.

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:34.650
I hated him.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:37.960
So I ran from his strictness to the 
shelter of my mother's kindness.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.500
And you say a crybaby like 
me possessed strong love?

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:42.820
Yes.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:43.680
What?

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:46.010
What is it you call "strong love"?!

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:50.370
It is still sleeping within you.

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:53.680
You must find it yourself, Kiriha.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:59.320
The answer lies within you.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.310
<i>Kiriha...</i>

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.250
<i>Don't die, Dad!</i>

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.950
<i>Mom already went to heaven!</i>

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:20.740
<i>Don't leave me alone!</i>

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.910
<i>Listen to me.</i>

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:28.560
<i>Stronger... Become stronger.</i>

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:34.130
<i>If you are strong... you will...</i>

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:36.520
<i>Aonuma-san, please calm down.</i>

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:38.710
<i>Dad...</i>

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:42.110
<i>Dad!</i>

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:49.580
I lost my parents in a sudden accident.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:51.600
I was alone.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:58.090
My kind relatives were betrayed by 
my father's trusted subordinates,

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:01.100
and our family's fortune was lost.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:10.360
And that's when I decided...

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:14.110
I would surpass my father. 
I would be stronger than he was.

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:19.690
That's why, when I was suddenly 
pulled into the Digital World,

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.500
I was pleased.

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:24.640
Here, I could test my strength 
to my heart's content,

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:28.110
and prove that I am the strongest.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:30.570
I can't lose.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:33.800
And if I can't stand at the top,

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:36.200
there's no point, even in winning!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.400
Kiriha...

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.820
I understand now, Kiriha...

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:44.590
what the darkness was 
that I sensed in you.

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.540
What?

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.920
It's just as Deckerdramon said.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.460
When you throw away love,

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.200
you become a Kiriha cloaked in darkness.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:55.520
But that's not the real Kiriha Aonuma!

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.510
You can't throw away love, Kiriha!

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:01.010
Isn't that what your dad 
was trying to tell you?

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:02.110
What did you say?!

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:08.750
No! Everyone get beneath me, quickly!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.210
What is that?!

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:11.270
Everyone back!

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:18.960
Deckerdramon!

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:23.090
Love? Don't make me puke.

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:31.140
Kiriha, it looks like you cannot 
obtain ultimate strength after all.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:36.320
I'll just have to destroy everything 
with my gravity bomb...

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:39.640
including you, of course.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.680
Deckerdramon!

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.800
Darn that Gravimon!

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:48.440
Shoutmon!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.090
Hey, Kiriha! You still don't get it?!

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:51.690
What?!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:54.410
Your strength, your power...

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.090
Don't you see that it's all in there?!

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.530
Kiriha! Kiriha!

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:02.500
I can fight now, Kiriha.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.070
Dracomon... MetalGreymon...

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:08.200
We will fight for you.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:09.970
We will protect you.

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.200
You guys...

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.400
You've grown, Kiriha...

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.850
And you've gotten stronger.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:25.290
I was worried about you. 
You were a crybaby, after all.

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:29.660
But you've overcome your 
sadness and grown stronger.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:34.390
You're not alone anymore.

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:39.360
The friends who will fight by your 
side are there, seeking your love.

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:42.840
My... love?

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:46.110
If you are strong...

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:47.550
If I am strong...

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.810
I can have true friends!

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:51.420
That's what you meant!

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:55.090
That is strong love.

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.850
Dad... I understand.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:05.930
Deckerdramon!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:09.130
Kiriha... You have found your answer.

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:12.090
I can feel your strong love.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.580
It's thanks to you.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:16.210
No... all of you taught me.

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:19.180
If I'm strong, I can have true friends.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.540
And those who have true friends

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:23.080
are the ones who are truly strong!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:23.790
Kiriha!

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:24.690
Kiriha!

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.270
You see?!

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:28.620
Just like I told you!

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:38.660
Deckerdramon!

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:46.950
Deckerdramon!

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.540
Deckerdramon! Hang in there!

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:55.230
Kiriha... It is time to say goodbye.

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:56.680
Get in the Xros Loader!

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:58.060
We have to heal your injuries!

00:18:58.060 --> 00:18:59.390
It's no use.

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:02.960
These injuries cannot be healed.

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:08.410
But I have seen your love.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:10.530
I am content.

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:12.730
No! You have to live!

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:14.570
Are you going to leave me, too?!

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:18.290
I am always watching over you.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:22.540
You have many friends by your side.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:29.850
Use that strong friendship 
to forge a new DigiXros.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.620
A new DigiXros?

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:35.770
Yes. I can see it...

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:40.870
A soldier of strong, deep love.

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:45.580
Kiriha... my General...

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:48.230
Thank you...

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:54.600
Deckerdramon!

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:11.320
Don't be so sad.

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:16.330
You'll all be going to the 
same place soon enough.

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.440
Taiki! Nene!

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:25.270
Yeah.

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:28.310
With the strength of all three of us.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.100
Here we go, everyone!

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.220
Great Xros!

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:46.620
Shoutmon!

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:48.910
MetalGreymon!

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:50.840
Digivolve!

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:52.350
OmegaShoutmon!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.160
Okay!

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:54.610
ZekeGreymon!

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:57.340
Ballistamon!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.040
Dorulumon!

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:02.650
Starmons!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:03.970
Yes!

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:06.880
Sparrowmon!

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:10.250
Great Xros!

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:34.380
Shoutmon X7!

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:38.770
Seven Victorize!

