Salamander Break</b>

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Burning Sal  
Salamande</b>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.450
Agnimon.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:33.500
His Burning Salamander attack releases 
a flame dragon from his fist.

00:22:33.500 --> 00:22:36.680
What? He can shoot flame 
dragons from his fist?

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:39.570
Get the fire extinguisher ready!

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:42.270
I thought we defeated Gravimon...

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:43.590
But he's still alive!

00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:45.690
As long as his core remains, 
he can keep coming back!

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:50.990
I will crush you all and make X7 mine!

